meta {
  name: 01 Patient Header (pid1)
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{base_url}}/patient?patient_id=98c4b82b-b07e-11f1-8334-022958ad0af8
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Cookie: copilot_session={{copilot_session}}
}

docs {
  Auth: requires the copilot_session environment variable to be set to a real,
  still-valid session cookie -- see bruno/README.md. Without it this 401s with
  {"detail": "Not logged in."} -- confirmed live 2026-09-20.

  pid1 = Alice Testpatient (same fixture as chat/01). With a valid session,
  expect 200:
    {"patient_id": "98c4b82b-b07e-11f1-8334-022958ad0af8",
     "name": "Alice Testpatient", "birth_date": "1972-03-14",
     "gender": "female"}
  -- confirmed live 2026-09-20, matching app/main.py's PatientHeader model.

  patient_id is required and must be a valid UUID (400 "Invalid patient id."
  if malformed, 404 "Patient not found." if well-formed but no such patient).
  Used by /ui's persistent patient header; this request lets you check the
  same lookup directly without going through the chat form.
}
